# Release check for tiny-go-lib

Dependencies are installed with `go mod download` and the tests run with `go test ./...`.
See the [testing guide](https://go.dev/doc/) and the [contributing notes](https://github.com/steplet-corpus/tiny-go-lib/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md).

Report the summary line exactly as printed.
